--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights (NOT distributed with this source)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are included in this repository. Packs are built locally
with tools/build_pack.py and side-loaded onto the device. Each pack records
its own licence in manifest.json, and the app marks a pack as
non-redistributable when its licence forbids redistribution.

  AI4Bharat IndicConformer-600M (ASR)      MIT
  ARTPARK-IISc DhVaani-0.5 (TTS)           Apache-2.0
  AI4Bharat IndicF5 (TTS)                  see upstream repository

  eSpeak NG                                GPL-3.0
    Used at BUILD TIME ONLY, as a generator of pronunciation rules that are
    compiled into a pack's lexicon. The eSpeak NG library is never linked
    into, bundled with, or loaded by the application, so its copyleft terms
    do not extend to this source or to the resulting APK.

  facebook/mms-tts-ory (Odia TTS)          CC-BY-NC-4.0
    EXCLUDED. The non-commercial clause makes it unusable for a deployable
    system. It is listed here only so that nobody adds it back by accident.

Anyone building packs is responsible for complying with the licence of each
upstream model.
